{"name":"Spreading Bushes","category":"tfc:farming_plus","icon":"tfcfarmingplus:food/goji","pages":[{"type":"patchouli:text","text":"This mod adds 8 spreading bushes: berry bushes, plus tea and coffee. They put out side branches and shoots once grown.$(br2)Plant on suitable soil and climate. Growth uses TFC settings; right-click when fruiting, then wait for bloom cooldown. Sharp tools recover main bushes (young spreading bushes may fail); canes drop sticks. Seasons shift in the south. Look for wild bushes in newly generated chunks."},{"type":"patchouli:empty"},{"type":"tfc:table","strings":[{"text":""},{"text":"Jan"},{"text":"Feb"},{"text":"Mar"},{"text":"Apr"},{"text":"May"},{"text":"Jun"},{"text":"Jul"},{"text":"Aug"},{"text":"Sep"},{"text":"Oct"},{"text":"Nov"},{"text":"Dec"},{"text":"Blackcurrant"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"Redcurrant"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"Haskap"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"Goji Berry"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"Serviceberry"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"Aronia"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"Tea Bush"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"Coffee Bush"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"}],"title":"Spreading Bush Calendar","text":"The fruiting calendar of the 8 spreading bushes.","legend":[{"text":"Dormant","color":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"Healthy","color":"0x6ab553"},{"text":"Flowering","color":"0xcca0db"},{"text":"Fruiting","color":"0xa217ff"}],"columns":12,"first_column_width":45,"column_width":15,"row_height":10,"left_buffer":8,"top_buffer":14,"draw_background":true},{"type":"patchouli:empty"},{"type":"patchouli:text","title":"Blackcurrant","anchor":"blackcurrant","text":"Can be found in regions with: $(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): -12°C - 22°C$(br)$(bold)Groundwater$(): 140 - 340mm$(br)$(bold)Forest coverage$(): 2 - 4$(br2)As a crop it needs $(bold)hydration$() 35 - 85 %.$(br2)Form: $(thing)spreading$() — it puts out side branches and shoots once grown.$(br2)Blackcurrant grows from April to May, flowers in June, and bears fruit in July and August. It can be found in damp, fertile valleys."},{"type":"tfc:multimultiblock","text":"A typical Blackcurrant bush.","multiblocks":[{"pattern":[["X"," "],["Y","Z"],["A","Z"],["0"," "]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfar